# IsoRim animals batch cats1 (blob style): Cougar, Panther, Lynx, Raccoon, Boomrat. Generated by tools/make_cats1_concept.py (v3).
# Kd = the sprite lit white (0.96); the textures hold the sprite colours relative to that white.
# Cougar, panther: white Cougar.png times the vanilla colour (ModelDef tintFromGraphic, Api 49: cougar (177,136,112), panther
# (60,60,60)); the review stand-in Kd (vanilla colour x 0.96) was replaced by the lit white at integration (2026-11-16).
# The panther is the cougar mesh x 0.9725 with its own material on the same texture.
# Lynx, raccoon, boomrat: vanilla tints only the mask area (CutoutComplex), so their colours are baked (no tintFromGraphic).
newmtl an_cougar_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Cougar

newmtl an_lynx_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Lynx

newmtl an_raccoon_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Raccoon

newmtl an_boomrat_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Boomrat

newmtl an_panther_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Cougar
